587 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 251 0 R
/E (The scikit-learn Pipeline object is the enforcement mechanism: when cross_validate\(pipeline, X, y, cv=inner_cv\) is called, Pipeline.fit_transform\(\) is called only on the training portion of each fold, and Pipeline.transform\(\) \(not fit_transform\) is called on the validation portion. This guarantees zero leakage. )
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [11]
>>
